s past to give you hints for your journey!</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Push It","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2819920/c00a6bb18a3234456dbdeb40c0a16d73b6262a3a.jpg"},{"name":"Carry On Wayward Son","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2819920/b10ef323ee2c7e198afcec783c50dd46b760bd28.jpg"},{"name":"Ashes To Ashes","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2819920/c56fb865db960e017666bffc7c4f9bbcc3e7b6af.jpg"},{"name":"Come Sail Away","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2819920/c9fff7a8e4425f92a90882be8fe7f34f262d8f2b.jpg"},{"name":"Up Where We Belong","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2819920/177a7ec853fbf87616a049faea2fc8a28f86859e.jpg"},{"name":"Jump","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2819920/1b08b5cd8b5ce1301687f012994e097a6dfea85a.jpg"},{"name":"Cold As Ice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2819920/911d96a4666d7239dc90de33d1a6920e2d1ade6d.jpg"},{"name":"I Am a Rock","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2819920/15dc8432af125d2658c23c49a0a1bb67ab400c22.jpg"},{"name":"Ring Of Fire","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2819920/af412017c87f32f6b8b6df3e8fe61299feb8ee46.jpg"},{"name":"Dust In the Wind","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2819920/b4a46be50b2a115354cb33a6eb87526c8293f693.jpg"}],"total":34},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2819920?t=1772726536","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819920/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772726536","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819920/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1